"><p id="doxf4UhlvecyrBlxp3WY7Z6t79P"><span>上线前</span></p></td><td id="doxCCrh5quN0yATgpv94MO4A0i4"><p id="doxY5cs5dc9E03IhvreJLdw4s3i"><span>尺寸按渠道要求</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="doxh1hBmdptK3hYdAdIVf7rHbJh"><span>三、资源交付节奏</span></h2><p id="doxkyuU1ykt3Zqf038RLzYU8I6V"><span>资源不是一次给完，而是按开发节奏分批交付，与开发并行推进。节奏如下：</span></p><table id="doxunnEOzc8t8rAwQfh0r3Y7Xwy"><colgroup><col id="colRKZVXiDktrpsyqWlAXOnFgS8Nq6VWPFDczjk" width="302"/><col id="colIGCNvVoQr3Npm9jYZZA4lYqZbR0138UdErbp" width="302"/></colgroup><tbody><tr id="rowcYTmAKGkzp26P6hxkJ41mXRcoKku8IRTkS9e" repeat-header="true" cant-split="true"><td id="dox3qxcZkW44ZR4VPiwZXgjZxE5"><p id="doxFe6pD2bRQtYIjFsg0ZqjTonW"><span>开发阶段</span></p></td><td id="doxaAZS7xcRuIV11q2nIbihcpZx"><p id="dox4Ety2MAiuxBA3QOsS8X1BElQ"><span>需要到位的资源</span></p></td></tr><tr id="rowYf23GDHRvH1g2OuqMtAHKu0TsANET6C3jYYh" cant-split="true"><td id="dox2mnTU2ETLo9YYNth8Ue6tbxE"><p id="dox1P9L9SVYxCDxaCOa2daZhF44"><span>立项评审</span></p></td><td id="doxjvea4BZ5WFj6PBKQ4W3tSVxh"><p id="doxdebKmfzY0gV45QOX14QmFJLh"><span>玩法想法、预算、周期目标</span></p></td></tr><tr id="rowzm11Tn1abyGk7lh9nm3jaQxsCeptRuvwsG3b" cant-split="true"><td id="dox5lMHInOj3cbCfo0Qo3IGin6j"><p id="doxulWedXmd451yMofiqXHfvnjy"><span>需求冻结</span></p></td><td id="doxWJHqPcHaxCnKdQZm3y7d2404"><p id="doxUFJMAkogniJYRXRDtXHKcdOE"><span>全部策划文档、剧情与文案主体</span></p></td></tr><tr id="roww92Jscg1xYFmoKmyJBT3DLgQUwoKIZyQl2IG" cant-split="true"><td id="doxBWXzUt2qMQ43F1MgnGB6m098"><p id="doxDUXliShgO7VCXOyZQrPfAClb"><span>技术原型</span></p></td><td id="doxLMv7zceqNMbbioZsbbuaiKn5"><p id="doxEnQVKZNEvi3844dsLZ3sDTiu"><span>占位资产（方块、简模即可，正式资产未到不阻塞）</span></p></td></tr><tr id="row2KipkhhEllPS3e2FocQBN4cdwYyWZsbGlT9G" cant-split="true"><td id="doxqTTaNFKXM147W5fvO2qX6qDE"><p id="doxij47HT2iZoeDKXc1hFIhJerz"><span>前端开发</span></p></td><td id="doxeOCkWFdIyzWjj7dyTxxu5Yha"><p id="doxH1i8n1N4T0lMBk0SIqbh3w3x"><span>首批角色模型、场景模型、贴图、UI</span></p></td></tr><tr id="row7JwiurKIBCvtr1Q8O2Wpujy9mSQoE2ayiBR0" cant-split="true"><td id="doxlu1pgqh2NUkykev7kb4g5fa4"><p id="doxlOtItmyvp2p25287iYWjon7E"><span>资源接入</span></p></td><td id="doxrPviurkezEdf7aBr6of7Ynwc"><p id="doxJRPemZER2H1EJyDfVwymFrBg"><span>全部美术、音频资产分批到位</span></p></td></tr><tr id="rowuXEMnhvZNAhwBUBvz5qMB4q514h70b74mSx1" cant-split="true"><td id="doxjF4KQQ6zomiJbLXSCLfdrKKc"><p id="dox3dzB0bOHDcDB5i7YGwHDuDZO"><span>联调测试</span></p></td><td id="doxWwAWH1UgxbovOjrj0gaexBip"><p id="doxrV0cYl27fd7ACKiELB4ZeVM9"><span>测试账号、资质证照（备案、</span><del><span>支付渠道</span></del><span>）</span></p></td></tr><tr id="rowvzLEczLlWpft81Vgac03nApRzoj5qLbkmz2q" cant-split="true"><td id="dox3fs3W1qXSMIbmAllHONzdmbL"><p id="dox3DUQteJhdHc5isF13QmGRskY"><span>上线</span></p></td><td id="doxd70FC4wOGHETA7Pt6eDoqwCj"><p id="doxsOkD340xcCLl0Mx5LFEdUyiv"><span>运营物料、</span><del><span>版号（付费游戏）</span></del></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxTddBCgkdKcL4ZaRZrAWKdkIM"><span>关键的并行原则：策划文档定稿后，美术、音频制作与前后端开发同时进行。开发者先用占位资源搭系统，公司按规格产出正式资产，在资源接入阶段替换。并行能压缩三分之一以上工期，代价是规格必须提前定死，否则资产做出来接不进去，返工成本远高于等待成本。</span></p><h2 id="doxxMwhum17H66pIpv0n2GDgTgr"><span>四、公司侧常见误区</span></h2><p id="doxuTmZ6NCxArXn3KMX6sLLp5ZG"><span>第一，资产规格不冻结就外包。建模外包按“好看”交付，接不进引擎，返工重做，成本翻倍。规格（单位、面数、命名、格式）必须在开工前由开发方确认并书面化。第二，资质拖到游戏做完再办。备案需提前申请，立项当天不启动，上线必然延期。第三，剧情文本不配置化。文案写死在游戏里，改一句台词要发版本；按编号配置化，运营期改文案即时生效。</span></p><h1 id="doxiJjgOOpM0qXKHRLX7YLSeS6a"><span>第四章 开发流程</span></h1><h2 id="doxidkLF36SysPuyTMycPmFOYy1"><span>一、九阶段主流程</span></h2><p id="doxpwHW6S0ZUxTldQHu2Lx7H1Cg"><span>项目从立项到上线运营，按九个阶段推进。每个阶段有明确的输入、输出、公司配合事项和出口标准，前一阶段不通过不进入下一阶段。</span></p><table id="doxEbHm6sw8FW151E0QBoMZPyCJ"><colgroup><col id="colosn4f8ThduW86uXCQxLuZAqt83LEPVpzfONO" width="151"/><col id="colo64gRG01fSY8xdD71ExTJo1F3bT3WC6JGE6p" width="151"/><col id="colKD28n6uxbKKQIxngf1DD4FEn5tT1p8C7eBjC" width="151"/><col id="col337UpdE51ZIyCzQU37ZioAgSxP1MyD5C9QD6" width="151"/></colgroup><tbody><tr id="rowbeumtKq9YoDc7w2xAIdpG4BwtubGysANueRE" repeat-header="true" cant-split="true"><td id="doxY4qGlv4H3GRMiRcNm6n9ah